(text "RAW HV -> 10k -> HV_FILTER -> 10k -> FCOM\n100nF/400V at HV_FILTER; 1uF/400V from FCOM to grounded PGND.\nFCOM is the amplifier reference. Connect the collector ONLY to SUM." (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "505b6716-a0fd-51cf-b3b4-847955684db5"))
(text "Nominal FCOM = 200 × 9.98M / (9.98M + 20k) = 199.6008 V.\nIndependent 9.98M bleeder gives 9.98 s nominal capacitor time constant.\nWhole-board discharge depends on module/cable capacitance and must be measured.\nMeasure raw HV and FCOM with rated instruments before touching or connecting ICSP." (at 15.24 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2d419c9b-07cd-5230-bd4f-9f50159adc04"))
(embedded_fonts no)
